# UI freeze (HFW auction)

Do not change participant-facing layout, labels, columns, colors, or interaction unless the user **explicitly** requests that UI change. Bug fixes that preserve the same UI are allowed.

Leaderboard (`/leaderboard/[auctionId]`, My Points, Competitors GW views): read and follow `auction-app/docs/ui-contracts/LEADERBOARD.md` before editing. New gameweeks are data only — do not add tabs or extra score columns.

If a task would “improve” or restyle the UI as a side effect, skip that part and say so.
